<title>TRINIDAD AND TOBAGO: CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT SRI LANKA BY 35 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WEST INDIES BEAT SRI LANKA BY 35 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT OF SPAIN, Trinidad 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies beat Sri Lanka by 35 runs in their one-off limited overs international at Queen's Park Oval on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 283-7 (49 overs), Sri Lanka 248-8 (49 overs).</p>
</text>
